# Configuration checklist; copy to an ignored private file and complete it.
# Required: explicit run_id and pilot_records (the legacy population variable).
# Existing deployments must retain their current private flags and identifiers.
# Enabling Jobs also requires verified image digests, git_sha and private quota
# contact configuration. Keep L4 disabled for the MVP.
